# 每日同步：各数据源 → 快照 → 汇率 → 净值 → 风险规则；有数据源失败时以失败结束（journalctl 里可见）
[Unit]
Description=portfolio-monitor 每日同步
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=%h/portfolio-monitor
ExecStart=%h/.local/bin/uv run --frozen --env-file .env portfolio-monitor sync
TimeoutStartSec=20min
